---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
---

<ServicePage
  slug="vat"
  title="VAT services"
  eyebrow="Service 04"
  lead="With the support of our experts, you can reduce the risk to your business and the burden on you as the owner."
  description="VAT registration, schemes, quarterly submissions and returns, handled by Belfast accountants."
  asideTitle="Take VAT off your plate"
  emailSubject="VAT"
>
  <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="vat-heading">
    <h2 id="vat-heading" class="h3">Small mistakes can be costly</h2>
    <p>
      VAT can be a daunting and time-consuming task to keep track of. If you're not up to date with the latest limits,
      schemes and registration requirements, quarterly submissions or returns, small mistakes can be costly.
    </p>
    <ul class="chips" aria-label="We cover">
      <li class="chip">VAT limits</li>
      <li class="chip">VAT schemes</li>
      <li class="chip">Registration</li>
      <li class="chip">Quarterly submissions</li>
      <li class="chip">Returns</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="callout" aria-labelledby="vat-unsure">
    <h2 id="vat-unsure">Not sure if this applies to you?</h2>
    <p>
      Don't worry. We're here to bring you up to speed on how VAT affects your business, or to take the task off your
      hands completely.
    </p>
  </section>
</ServicePage>
